},{"awesomeListRepo":"pFarb/awesome-crypto-papers","categoryHTML":"<h2>The list</h2><h4>Zero Knowledge Proofs</h4>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://github.com/manjunath5496/Shafi-Goldwasser-Publications/blob/master/1989-siamjc.pdf\">Knowledge complexity of interactive proof systems</a> - By GoldWasser, Micali and Rackoff. Defining computational complexity of \"knowledge\" within zero knowledge proofs.</li>","updatedAt":"2022-01-16T13:44:54.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"pFarb/awesome-crypto-papers","categoryHTML":"<h2>The list</h2><h4>Zero Knowledge Proofs</h4>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://citeseerx.ist.psu.edu/viewdoc/download?doi=10.1.1.186.4901&#x26;rep=rep1&#x26;type=pdf\">Zero Knowledge Protocols and Small Systems</a> - A good intro into Zero knowledge protocols.</li>","updatedAt":"2022-01-16T13:44:54.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"pFarb/awesome-crypto-papers","categoryHTML":"<h2>The list</h2><h3>Books</h3>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://cacr.uwaterloo.ca/hac/\">Handbook of Applied Cryptography</a> - By Alfred J. Menezes, Paul C. van Oorschot and Scott A. Vanstone. Good classical introduction into cryptography and ciphers.</li>","updatedAt":"2022-01-16T13:44:54.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"mostafatouny/awesome-theoretical-computer-science","categoryHTML":"<h2>Talks</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://www.dcs.warwick.ac.uk/~igorcarb/complexity-meetings.html\">Oxford-Warwick Complexity Meetings</a> - Online informal talks dedicated to topics of interest in computational complexity theory and related areas. The goal is to serve as a forum for discussion and quick dissemination of results.</li>","updatedAt":"2022-01-16T07:39:14.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"mostafatouny/awesome-theoretical-computer-science","categoryHTML":"<h2>Useful Links</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/complexitynetwork/home\">Complexity Network</a> - Hosts collaboration between the three computational complexity groups at Imperial College London, University of Oxford and University of Warwick. It promotes smooth flow of ideas between the three groups and beyond.</li>","updatedAt":"2022-01-16T07:39:14.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"rust-unofficial/awesome-rust","categoryHTML":"<h2>Applications</h2><h3>Security tools</h3>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://github.com/b23r0/abcdict\">abcdict</a><a data-role=\"trackawesomelist-badge\" href=\"https://github.com/b23r0/abcdict\" style=\"text-decoration:none;top: -2px;position: relative;margin-left:4px;margin-right:4px;font-weight:400;\"><span style=\"color: #fff;font-size: 11px;font-family: Verdana, Geneva, DejaVu Sans,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 4px 4px 6px;background: #555;border-top-left-radius: 4px;border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;\">stars</span><span style=\"padding: 4px 6px 4px 4px;background: #007ec6;border-top-right-radius: 4px;border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;\">52</span></span></a><!--TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_START____{\"type\":\"repo\",\"stargazerCount\":52,\"repo\":\"b23r0/abcdict\"}____TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_END--> - A better customization password dictionary generator. <a href=\"https://github.com/b23r0/abcdict/actions/workflows/rust.yml\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/workflow/status/b23r0/abcdict/Rust\" alt=\"Build Status\"></a></li>","updatedAt":"2022-01-16T07:30:23.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"mostafatouny/awesome-theoretical-computer-science","categoryHTML":"<h2>Useful Links</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://dmatheorynet.blogspot.com/\">Theory Announcements</a> - DMANET spreads information on conferences, workshops, seminars etc. relating to discrete mathematics and algorithms.</li>","updatedAt":"2022-01-16T04:24:57.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"hangtwenty/dive-into-machine-learning","categoryHTML":"<h2>Other courses</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://github.com/microsoft/Data-Science-For-Beginners\"><code>microsoft/Data-Science-For-Beginners</code></a> — <a href=\"https://dev.to/azure/free-data-science-for-beginners-curriculum-on-github-1h